inking)\n- Lives with his brother in a rented house\n- Education: Completed 10th grade, obtained GED\n- Legal: 2 prior DUIs, current DUI charges pending from this crash. License was suspended at time of crash.\n\n**Family History**: Father died of alcoholic cirrhosis at age 52. Mother has depression. Paternal uncle with alcohol use disorder.\n\n**Current Medications**: Levetiracetam 750 mg BID, thiamine 100 mg daily, folic acid 1 mg daily, multivitamin daily, famotidine 20 mg BID, docusate 100 mg BID, sertraline 50 mg daily (started for post-TBI depression)',
